      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "AI resistant learning conditions are just less exploitative teacher worker conditions.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mzazk5zyhc2b",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-01T14:30:50.389Z",
