      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzazhp3tk22v",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Not sure I could identify a story about that. “There Will Come Soft Rains” and other stories in its ilk are about how automation will continue after everyone is gone. The updated version would have AI servers continuing to write, send, and  respond to email long after everyone is gone.",
